question.en:
This test fails about once a week on CI and always passes on your laptop. What is wrong, and what is the fix?

```ts
test('saves the profile', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/profile');
  await page.getByLabel('Display name').fill('Mai');
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Save' }).click();
  await page.waitForTimeout(2000);
  expect(await page.getByRole('status').textContent()).toBe('Profile saved');
});
```

